# Upstash Redis Configuration (Optional - for cross-device sync between Mobile & Laptop)
# 1. Create a free Redis database at https://console.upstash.com (100% Free Forever)
# 2. Copy the REST URL and REST Token from the "REST API" section on Upstash:
VITE_UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
VITE_UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Note: If left empty, the portfolio automatically operates in offline-first mode
# using your browser's localStorage, so everything works immediately out of the box!
